xlab.com/zh/author/yilin-hao/","publishdate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/author/yilin-hao/","section":"authors","summary":"","tags":null,"title":"郝一霖","type":"authors"},{"authors":["Sanghuiyu Yan"],"categories":null,"content":"","date":-62135596800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"term","lang":"zh","lastmod":-62135596800,"objectID":"898874035502593006daa2bf8e742f36","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/author/sanghuiyu-yan/","publishdate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/author/sanghuiyu-yan/","section":"authors","summary":"","tags":null,"title":"阎桑慧宇","type":"authors"},{"authors":["Shuhang Chen"],"categories":null,"content":"","date":-62135596800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"term","lang":"zh","lastmod":-62135596800,"objectID":"0ef2cb381fd7aeb3aea541e8dd21c5e6","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/author/shuhang-chen/","publishdate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/author/shuhang-chen/","section":"authors","summary":"","tags":null,"title":"陈书航","type":"authors"},{"authors":["Rui Ma"],"categories":null,"content":"","date":-62135596800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"term","lang":"zh","lastmod":-62135596800,"objectID":"c314db29c66da085943174b1b81c08bb","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/author/rui-ma/","publishdate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/author/rui-ma/","section":"authors","summary":"","tags":null,"title":"马瑞","type":"authors"},{"authors":["Zhiwei Huang"],"categories":null,"content":"","date":-62135596800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"term","lang":"zh","lastmod":-62135596800,"objectID":"f2a58268911d5274e5e51bbde7e19ae2","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/author/zhiwei-huang/","publishdate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/author/zhiwei-huang/","section":"authors","summary":"","tags":null,"title":"黄知微","type":"authors"},{"authors":null,"categories":null,"content":"Traffic Agent 是一个面向交通分析任务的研究原型。它把交通问数、地图交互、知识检索和报告整理放进同一个对话式工作台。用户可以从一个具体的交通问题出发，查看相关数据和空间证据，并在多轮任务中保留中间结果。\nAgent 会根据问题选择数据查询、空间分析、检索和可视化工具。输出主要用于辅助分析与复核，不替代交通专业判断。\n","date":1786550400,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1786550400,"objectID":"573b3257c986afe62e7c4e9a40113f81","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/application/traffic-agent/","publishdate":"2026-08-13T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/application/traffic-agent/","section":"application","summary":"一个面向交通分析任务的研究原型，将交通问数、地图交互、知识检索与报告整理放在同一个对话式工作台中。","tags":null,"title":"Traffic Agent","type":"application"},{"authors":["王奥","Zhiwen Chen","Shen Wang","夏强","周漪","李健"],"categories":null,"content":"研究概览 CityWeave 面向真实的门到门出行规划，同时考虑用户画像、时间窗口、地图拓扑和交通方式等约束。方法将规划过程拆解为 Who、When、Where 和 How 四个结构化槽位，再通过 User-World Grounding 模块检查个性化需求与导航可行性。\n核心方法与发现 以 3W1H 结构约束多模态智能体的长链路推理和工具调用。 联合优化用户偏好、地点存在性、路线连通性、换乘合法性和时刻表约束。 在 18 万条真实出行规划记录上进行训练和评测，显著提升最终方案通过率、常识约束通过率、个性化和可靠性。 资料来源 ACM 论文 DOI TransportX Lab 公众号解读 ","date":1786118400,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1786118400,"objectID":"c91dfd85e67e911ca1aed85a441ae1c1","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/publication/cityweave/","publishdate":"2026-08-08T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/cityweave/","section":"publication","summary":"A grounded multimodal agent that reconciles traveler preferences with real-world route constraints.","tags":["Mobility planning","Multimodal agents","User-world grounding","Reinforcement learning","Urban computing"],"title":"CityWeave: Weaving User Needs and World Constraints for Personalized and Reliable Mobility Planning","type":"publication"},{"authors":null,"categories":null,"content":"2026 年 7 月 17 日至 18 日，TransportX 参加 2026 年城市交通规划年会。李健副教授在大会作报告，并参与专题论坛 4“交通开放共享创新生态”的交流。\n课题组参会成员： 李健、夏强、果金杉\n7 月 17 日：大会报告 李健副教授作题为《与 AI 同行：构建开放共享的城市交通协同创新生态》的报告。报告提出，以具体业务部门的真实需求为牵引，利用 AI 智能体技术，构建由场景与业务理解、模型与工具体系以及数据开放规则共同支撑的开放治理模式。通过联合实验室、治理沙盒等形式，逐步形成可复制、可推广的城市交通开放共享协同创新生态。\n7 月 17 日，李健副教授在大会作报告。 7 月 18 日：专题论坛 4 7 月 18 日上午，专题论坛 4“交通开放共享创新生态”举行。论坛由广州市交通规划研究院有限公司与同济大学承办，围绕交通融合、数据治理和智能工具研发等议题展开交流，讨论数字时代的交通开放、技术共享与跨界协同。\n专题论坛 4“交通开放共享创新生态”议程。 专题论坛 4 参会嘉宾合影。 专题论坛 4 现场交流。 相关资料 TransportX Lab 公众号：与 AI 同行：构建开放共享的城市交通协同创新生态 下载报告图文 PDF（8 页） ","date":1784332800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1784332800,"objectID":"f6b216cb857b799520f03d37ac2ccc72","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/post/2026-urban-transport-planning-ai-ecosystem/","publishdate":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/post/2026-urban-transport-planning-ai-ecosystem/","section":"post","summary":"7 月 17 日，李健副教授作大会报告；7 月 18 日，TransportX 参与专题论坛 4“交通开放共享创新生态”的交流。","tags":null,"title":"团队参加 2026 年城市交通规划年会","type":"post"},{"authors":["夏强","Zijian Zhang","王奥","Wenhan Wang","Xiangyu Wang","李健"],"categories":null,"content":"研究概览 HSGraphAgent 将海关 HS 编码体系建模为包含层级关系和排除规则的知识图谱，引导大语言模型从 Section、Chapter、Heading 到 Subheading 逐级完成商品归类。该方法强调规则约束与可解释推理，避免仅凭文本相似度选择编码。\n核心方法与发现 Select 阶段只在当前节点的合法子节点中选择，保证层级路径有效。 Redirect 阶段在触发税则排除条件时动态修正推理路径。 在 6 位 HS Code 细粒度任务上，图谱引导的分层推理明显优于直接生成和常规 RAG 基线。 资料来源 ACL Anthology DOI HSBench 代码与数据 TransportX Lab 公众号解读 ","date":1782835200,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1782835200,"objectID":"4f98eb863ff127ebe98c947277c83e6f","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/publication/hsgraphagent/","publishdate":"2026-07-01T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/hsgraphagent/","section":"publication","summary":"A rule-aware graph agent for accurate and explainable Harmonized System code classification.","tags":["Harmonized System","Customs classification","Knowledge graph","Large language models","Rule-guided reasoning"],"title":"HSGraphAgent: Knowledge-Graph-Guided Large Language Models for Harmonized System Code Classification","type":"publication"},{"authors":["陈冉冉","李健"],"categories":null,"content":"研究概览 本研究面向气候变化下不断上升的洪水风险，将未来洪水情景生成、两阶段随机优化和离散事件仿真整合到同一人道主义物流规划框架中。框架同时考虑灾前设施与库存决策、灾后调拨方案以及动态配送过程的服务质量。\n核心方法与发现 结合 2006–2024 年历史灾情、AutoML 和 CMIP6 气候投影，构造面向 2026–2055 年的未来洪水需求情景。 通过包含 CVaR 风险度量的两阶段随机规划，联合决定区域仓库、库存预置、配送中心启用和物资分配。 江汉平原案例表明，面向未来且考虑风险规避的方案能够显著减少短缺，并在仿真中提高服务达标率。 资料来源 论文 DOI TransportX Lab 公众号解读 ","date":1781625600,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1781625600,"objectID":"2031df486322df191782fc4128e2a241","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/publication/humanitarian-logistics-flood-risk/","publishdate":"2026-06-17T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/humanitarian-logistics-flood-risk/","section":"publication","summary":"A data-driven planning framework that connects future climate scenarios, risk-aware optimization, and operational simulation.","tags":["Humanitarian logistics","Flood risk","Stochastic programming","Climate change","CVaR","Discrete-event simulation"],"title":"Humanitarian logistics planning for future flood risks: a data-driven stochastic framework","type":"publication"},{"authors":[],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1780588800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1780588800,"objectID":"176ac745dc589f0e4c4a753043cccb5c","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/group-meeting-2026-06-05/","publishdate":"2026-06-05T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/event/group-meeting-2026-06-05/","section":"event","summary":"本次组会收录 3 篇文献阅读分享。","tags":["组会","文献分享"],"title":"组会 | 2026-06-05","type":"event"},{"authors":[],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1779984e3,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1779984e3,"objectID":"366317536dead71c46d5ad7e74663463","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/group-meeting-2026-05-29/","publishdate":"2026-05-29T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/event/group-meeting-2026-05-29/","section":"event","summary":"本次组会收录 3 篇文献阅读分享。","tags":["组会","文献分享"],"title":"组会 | 2026-05-29","type":"event"},{"authors":[],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1778774400,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1778774400,"objectID":"8805373a4f9b4bbc1f020c7e8b1061a9","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/