:"","date":1748793600,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1748793600,"objectID":"d8122a571ed0fa1ad71bc1927e5e17ab","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-06-02/","publishdate":"2025-06-02T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-06-02/","section":"event","summary":"本次组会收录 2 篇文献阅读分享。","tags":["组会","文献分享"],"title":"组会 | 2025-06-02","type":"event"},{"authors":["查文斌","李健"],"categories":null,"content":"研究概览 本研究以上海通勤者为对象，探讨暴雨预警如何通过预警可信度、风险感知、自我效能和感知可达性影响通勤决策。研究将保护行动决策模型扩展到城市交通场景，关注预警信息、个体心理判断与出行调整之间的作用链。\n核心方法与发现 基于 1,563 份有效问卷，构建多阶段社会心理决策模型。 社会经济地位较低的通勤者更容易出现较低的预警信任、自我效能和感知可达性。 感知可达性与继续出行意愿正相关，与更换交通方式的倾向负相关；不同通勤方式的感知可达性存在显著差异。 资料来源 论文 DOI TransportX Lab 公众号解读 ","date":1748707200,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1748707200,"objectID":"a0bc9072bbd05af4958fffce3f6d4119","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/publication/rainstorm-perceived-accessibility/","publishdate":"2025-06-01T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/rainstorm-perceived-accessibility/","section":"publication","summary":"A behavioral framework explaining how rainstorm warnings reshape perceived accessibility and commuting intentions.","tags":["Rainstorm warnings","Perceived accessibility","Travel intentions","Structural equation modeling","Disaster management"],"title":"Understanding commuters' perceived accessibility and travel intentions under rainstorm warnings in Shanghai, China","type":"publication"},{"authors":[],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1748188800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1748188800,"objectID":"d9b2b575994dbdecad5d9b0af0e6aad8","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-05-26/","publishdate":"2025-05-26T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-05-26/","section":"event","summary":"本次组会收录 2 篇文献阅读分享。","tags":["组会","文献分享"],"title":"组会 | 2025-05-26","type":"event"},{"authors":[],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1747584e3,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1747584e3,"objectID":"20337a7f56f8eb615242349aafd00b91","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-05-19/","publishdate":"2025-05-19T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-05-19/","section":"event","summary":"本次组会收录 2 篇文献阅读分享。","tags":["组会","文献分享"],"title":"组会 | 2025-05-19","type":"event"},{"authors":[],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1746979200,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1746979200,"objectID":"eebd468c47b0778c8f1792e18de2de2e","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-05-12/","publishdate":"2025-05-12T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-05-12/","section":"event","summary":"本次组会收录 2 篇文献阅读分享。","tags":["组会","文献分享"],"title":"组会 | 2025-05-12","type":"event"},{"authors":[],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1746460800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1746460800,"objectID":"931c5f7ce08dc83dd201e252322d37dd","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-05-06/","publishdate":"2025-05-06T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-05-06/","section":"event","summary":"本次组会收录 2 篇文献阅读分享。","tags":["组会","文献分享"],"title":"组会 | 2025-05-06","type":"event"},{"authors":[],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1745769600,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1745769600,"objectID":"22e03e56618dbc3cfdfebbfcd0d7baaa","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-04-28/","publishdate":"2025-04-28T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-04-28/","section":"event","summary":"本次组会收录 2 篇文献阅读分享。","tags":["组会","文献分享"],"title":"组会 | 2025-04-28","type":"event"},{"authors":[],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1745164800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1745164800,"objectID":"edcdb55cbae320c5c8320c78c12d3090","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-04-21/","publishdate":"2025-04-21T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-04-21/","section":"event","summary":"本次组会收录 2 篇文献阅读分享。","tags":["组会","文献分享"],"title":"组会 | 2025-04-21","type":"event"},{"authors":[],"categories":null,"content":"","date":174456e4,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":174456e4,"objectID":"ca796b07e4385f6b397e70cc61f26baf","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-04-14/","publishdate":"2025-04-14T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/event/group-meeting-2025-04-14/","section":"event","summary":"本次组会收录 2 篇文献阅读分享。","tags":["组会","文献分享"],"title":"组会 | 2025-04-14","type":"event"},{"authors":["李健","甘田","Weifeng Li","刘宇航"],"categories":null,"content":"研究概览 本研究针对手机信令数据时间稀疏、空间定位不确定以及传统聚类方法依赖人工阈值的问题，将个体轨迹组织为时空知识图谱。方法同时推断停留点的空间邻接关系和时间相似关系，再识别紧密关联的活动地点群。\n核心方法与发现 用三元组表示个体、停留点、时间片及其关系，形成可解释的轨迹语义结构。 基于 Queen 邻接构建空间图，基于时间片余弦相似度构建时间图，并将两者融合。 使用 Louvain 社区发现自动识别活动地点，在上海案例中改善空间边界精度和日间稳定性。 资料来源 论文 DOI TransportX Lab 公众号解读 ","date":1743436800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1743436800,"objectID":"dc04b08631b09f60da57fd65a768afed","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/publication/stkg-activity-location/","publishdate":"2025-04-01T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/stkg-activity-location/","section":"publication","summary":"A parameter-light graph method that fuses spatial and temporal relationships to identify activity locations.","tags":["Human mobility","Mobile phone data","Activity location","Spatiotemporal knowledge graph","Community detection"],"title":"A spatiotemporal knowledge graph-based method for identifying individual activity locations from mobile phone data","type":"publication"},{"authors":null,"categories":null,"content":"城市交通是新技术、新产业的重要栖息地，是典型的知识、技术密集型行业，涵盖了交通运输、城乡规划、社会学、经济学、管理学等多个学科门类，应用场景多样且差异性较大。因此，从业人员对复杂问题的认知水平和新技术的掌握能力是培育新质生产力的关键。\n本文从知识图谱与大语言模型融合的思路出发，提出城市交通知识增强大语言模型系统架构，并探索提示词工程、检索增强生成、模型融合及智能体构建技术。\n","date":1742342400,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1742342400,"objectID":"2fbbc6f93bd8b3fa538b7b32b146dc10","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/post/20-12-02-icml-best-paper/","publishdate":"2025-03-19T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/post/20-12-02-icml-best-paper/","section":"post","summary":"城市交通是新技术、新产业的重要栖息地，是典型的知识、技术密集型行业，涵盖了交通运输、城乡规划、社会学、经济学、管理学等多个学科门类，应用场景多样且差异性较大。因此，从业人员对复杂问题的认知水平和新技术的掌握能力是培育新质生产力的关键。\n","tags":null,"title":"城市交通知识增强大语言模型构建及应用探索","type":"post"},{"authors":["王奥","朱国军","李健"],"categories":null,"content":"研究概览 本研究面向危险货物供应链中的多部门协同监管、数据孤岛与责任追溯问题，设计了由区块链层、存储层、接口层和交互层组成的概念平台。平台结合 FISCO BCOS、IPFS 和智能合约，支持多类数据的链上共享与监管过程追踪。\n核心方法与发现 根据数据体量与隐私需求，设计三种数据集成和链上共享模式。 将可追溯状态机编码为智能合约，保留监管任务流转和责任链条。 八节点原型实验表明，方案能够在可接受的延迟和吞吐水平下支撑数据共享与复杂监管追溯。 资料来源 论文 DOI TransportX Lab 公众号解读 ","date":1738339200,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1738339200,"objectID":"f6d3d6dfc140804baaf9fbcd94b80d36","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/publication/dangerous-goods-blockchain-supervision/","publishdate":"2025-02-01T00:00:00+08:00","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/dangerous-goods-blockchain-supervision/","section":"publication","summary":"A blockchain platform for cross-agency data sharing and traceable dangerous-goods supervision.","tags":["Dangerous goods","Supply chain supervision","Blockchain","IPFS","Smart contracts","Traceability"],"title":"Collaborative supervision of dangerous goods supply chain: A blockchain-based conceptual platform","type":"publication"},{"authors":null,"categories":null,"content":"","date":1666569600,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1666569600,"objectID":"d161a3dcbc5ec612179fa77a630491e9","permalink":"https://transportxlab.com/zh/tour/","publishdate":"2022-10-24T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/tour/","section":"","summary":"","tags":null,"title":"课题组","type":"landing"},{"authors":null,"categories":null,"content":"","date"